        "id": "a-intersects-alpha-at-A",
        "description": "Single source group: alpha plane footprint, A inside/B above-right outside, both on a; alpha left, a lower-left, A below-right/B above-left. Solid exterior then dashed lower crossing to A then solid through B. No labelled/filled outline crossings. Spatial unique-intersection and projected-outside checks are in projection-check.json.",
        "objects": [
